# Panic-sites budget (scripts/panic-sites.py, `just panic-sites`, ADR-0051):
# the panic-class sites per file of the tiered crates, counted by one clippy
# pass with the panic set as `-W` flags over `--lib --bins`. Each entry is a
# file that had sites when it was listed, with their count: it goes down, and
# up only by sites moved into its file or revealed by a rule the base did not
# count. An unlisted file has none. `just panic-sites-update` lowers an entry,
# removes it at zero, and raises or adds one by those moved and revealed sites.
# A crate with no entry carries the zero attribute at its roots
# (`just panic-sites` names it).

crates/b2bua/src/rules/actions/dispatch.rs 1
